  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your gnome magic takes on mythic qualities.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Haunted Gnome<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use haunting mists<sup>UM</sup> once per day as a racial spell-like ability, and you can expend mythic power to use the mythic or augmented mythic versions of your ghost sound, haunted fey aspect UC, and haunting mist spell-like abilities. If you can cast the spells of the same name, you can also cast the mythic versions of those spells, as though you had learned them with Mythic Spell Lore.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc165\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
